# Local override for the memql-cockpit binary's environment.
#
# Copy this file to .env in this same directory; the binary will
# layer your values on top of whatever the genesis envelope (or
# host shell) painted into the process environment. .env is
# gitignored, so each developer keeps their own copy.
#
# Authoritative source: memql/component/genesis/localenv.go.
#
# Rules:
#   - One KEY=VALUE per line. # for comments. Blank lines OK.
#   - Optional matching single/double quotes around the value.
#   - Optional `export ` prefix tolerated.
#   - MEMQL_MASTER_KEY is the one variable that CANNOT be
#     overridden here -- genesis owns it as the trust anchor.
#     Everything else is fair game.

# Observability verbosity (mirrors the memql binary's setting).
# off | count | meta | verbose
# MEMQL_OBSERVE_LEVEL=verbose

# Force a specific cluster / endpoint without --cluster / --endpoint
# flags every launch.
# MEMQL_COCKPIT_DEFAULT_CLUSTER=local

# Bump log verbosity locally.
# MEMQL_LOG_LEVEL=debug
